<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH 1997 DEFICIT GROWS TO CZK 14.8 BLN END-JUNE.</title>
<headline>CZECH 1997 DEFICIT GROWS TO CZK 14.8 BLN END-JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech 1997 state budget showed a deficit of 14.827 billion crowns ($459.5 million) at the end of June, compared with a 12.2 billion crown deficit at the end of May, the finance ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>End-June revenue totalled 241.508 billion crowns while expenditure totalled 256.335 billion, the ministry said.</p>
